                <head>Appendix 125</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[<hi rendition="#italic">Resolution From the</hi>] <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Raw Materials Section</hi></p>
                <p>The following resolution was passed:— <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Raw Materials Section approves of the scheme of arrangement pledging
                            German stocks of dyestuffs as security for an advance for supplies of
                            food to Germany, and, subject to financial approval, proposes to put the
                            scheme in operation unless the Supreme Economic Council or the Council
                            of the Heads of Governments sees any objection.”</p></quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
